{"attributes":{"stable_path":"/documentation/Documentation@2f638430-35b9-49f6-98e9-f5d78c7588df","sysml_id":"2f638430-35b9-49f6-98e9-f5d78c7588df","element_id":"2f638430-35b9-49f6-98e9-f5d78c7588df","sysml_type":"Documentation","owner_id":"5f4d3ef2-a408-4634-ae97-a8189db50167","owning_namespace_id":"5f4d3ef2-a408-4634-ae97-a8189db50167","owning_relationship_id":"93bedcfa-e21e-4fbe-9f09-f5176c598647","owning_membership_id":"93bedcfa-e21e-4fbe-9f09-f5176c598647","is_library_element":false,"is_implied_included":false,"body":"Activates and maintains the tiger warning after a verified\ndetection; new detections reset the timeout, and a timeout or stop\nreturns the system to idle.\nRequirements: TDS_WRN_001, TDS_WRN_002, TDS_WRN_003, TDS_WRN_004,\nTDS_WRN_005.\n"},"concept":"documentation","metamodel":"SysMLv2","namespace":"System_Model_Tiger_Detection"},
{"attributes":{"stable_path":"/documentation/Documentation@2f8840fd-c940-4238-9a08-8b12db1d0948","sysml_id":"2f8840fd-c940-4238-9a08-8b12db1d0948","element_id":"2f8840fd-c940-4238-9a08-8b12db1d0948","sysml_type":"Documentation","owner_id":"99b5661b-8dd3-4e06-b03c-3a1e2c915119","owning_namespace_id":"99b5661b-8dd3-4e06-b03c-3a1e2c915119","owning_relationship_id":"81681975-fe44-4922-85e3-e56272139676","owning_membership_id":"81681975-fe44-4922-85e3-e56272139676","is_library_element":false,"is_implied_included":false,"body":"The lifecycle controller uses current operational state, state-entry timestamp and capability history. Produce CapabilityAvailable after startup qualification; CapabilityUnavailable on loss; RecoveryQualified only after T_recovery_stable; StartupTimeout after T_startup without qualification. "},"concept":"documentation","metamodel":"SysMLv2","namespace":"System_Model_Tiger_Detection"},
